To build a RK8E (RK05) system with 6 areas (A:-F:) and still have room for
other useful handlers, the system is built with SYS:,C:-F: and DSK: is set
to B: (but B: is NOT installed!).  After the system is built FUTIL is used
to change locations 14.164 to 0100 and 14.165 to 0200 (check: 14.166=0300)
and location 66.141 from 0000 to 5723 (automatic .AS A: DSK: on bootup...)
